							ArcByLength(eArc3.CenterPoint, eArc3.Radius, eArc3.StartAngle, eArc3.EndAngle, eArc3.geoLength + Length, ArcDirectionType.FromStart, ref CalcSA8, ref CalcEA8);
							ExtendedEntity = new eArc(eArc3.CenterPoint, eArc3.Radius, CalcSA8, CalcEA8, Plane);
						}
						else
						{
							ExtendedEntity = new eArc(eArc3.CenterPoint, eArc3.Radius, eArc3.StartAngle, num4, Plane);
						}
						Done = true;
					}
				}
			}
			if (!Done & (Math.Abs(Length) > 0.0))
			{
				LineWithLengthAndAngle(centerPnt, Length, num3, Plane, ref BasePnt, ref EndPnt);
				ExtendedEntity = new eLine(EndPnt, pnt3D);
				Done = true;
			}
		}
		catch (Exception mSException)
		{
			string text = "RefEntities: " + RefEntities.ToString() + " - BaseEntity: " + ExtendEntity.ToString() + " - ExtendPoint: " + ExtendPoint.ToString() + " - Length: " + Length + " - Resolution: " + Resolution + " - Plane: " + Plane.ToString();
			buLog.addLog(text, "Not Ok", MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name);
			buException.throwException(mSException, MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name, ShowMessageBox: false, text);
		}
	}

	public void Explode(ExplodeEventVar Options, List<eEntities> RefEntities, ref List<eEntities> CalcEntities)
	{
		CalcEntities.Clear();
		for (int i = 0; i <= RefEntities.Count - 1; i++)
		{
			Explode(Options, RefEntities[i], ref CalcEntities);
		}
	}

	public void Explode(ExplodeEventVar Options, eEntities RefEntity, ref List<eEntities> CalcEntities)
	{
		try
		{
			eEntities eEntities2 = new eEntities();
			eEntities2 = eEntities.CopyEntity(RefEntity);
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eLine) && Options.PolylineToLine)
			{
				eEntities2.GroupIndex = 0;
				CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(ePolyline) && Options.PolylineToLine)
			{
				for (int i = 1; i <= RefEntity.Vertice.Count - 1; i++)
				{
					eEntities2 = new eLine(RefEntity.Vertice[i - 1], RefEntity.Vertice[i], RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
					eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eCircle))
			{
				if (Options.CircleToPolyline)
				{
					eEntities2 = new ePolyline(RefEntity.Vertice, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
					eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
				if (Options.CircleToArc)
				{
					for (int j = 0; j <= 3; j++)
					{
						eEntities2 = new eArc(((eCircle)RefEntity).CenterPoint, ((eCircle)RefEntity).Radius, (double)j * 90.0, (double)(j + 1) * 90.0, ((eCircle)RefEntity).Plane, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
						eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
						CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
					}
				}
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eArc))
			{
				if (!Options.ArcToPolyline)
				{
					eEntities2.GroupIndex = -1;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
				else
				{
					eEntities2 = new ePolyline(RefEntity.Vertice, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
					eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eEllipse) && Options.EllipseToPolyline)
			{
				eEntities2 = new ePolyline(RefEntity.Vertice, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
				eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
				CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eEllipseArc) && Options.ArcEllipseToPolyline)
			{
				eEntities2 = new ePolyline(RefEntity.Vertice, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
				eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
				CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eBSpline))
			{
				if (Options.CurveToPolyline)
				{
					eEntities2 = new ePolyline(RefEntity.Vertice, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
					eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
				if (Options.CurveToControlPoints)
				{
					eEntities2 = new ePolyline(((eBSpline)RefEntity).ControlPoints, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
					eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eBezeir))
			{
				if (Options.CurveToPolyline)
				{
					eEntities2 = new ePolyline(RefEntity.Vertice, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
					eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
				if (Options.CurveToControlPoints)
				{
					eEntities2 = new ePolyline(((eBezeir)RefEntity).ControlPoints, RefEntity.dispThickness, RefEntity.dispColor);
					eEntities2.LayerIndex = RefEntity.LayerIndex;
					CalcEntities.Add(eEntities2);
				}
			}
		}
		catch (Exception mSException)
		{
			string text = "RefEntity: " + RefEntity.ToString();
			buLog.addLog(text, "Not Ok", MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name);
			buException.throwException(mSException, MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name, ShowMessageBox: false, text);
		}
	}

	public int Combine(eEntities FirstEntity, eEntities SecondEntity, Pnt3D RefPoint, ref eEntities CombinedEntity)
	{
		try
		{
			List<eEntities> list = new List<eEntities>();
			list.Add(eEntities.CopyEntity(FirstEntity));
			list.Add(eEntities.CopyEntity(SecondEntity));
			Combine(list, RefPoint, new WorkPlane(), ref CombinedEntity);
			return 1;
		}
		catch (Exception)
		{
			return -1;
		}
	}

	public int Combine(List<eEntities> RefEntities, Pnt3D RefPoint, WorkPlane Plane, ref eEntities CombinedEntity)
	{
		try
		{
			List<eEntities> list = new List<eEntities>();
			List<eEntities> list2 = new List<eEntities>();
			double num = 0.0;
			double num2 = 0.0;
			Pnt3D pnt3D = new Pnt3D();
			Pnt3D pnt3D2 = new Pnt3D();
			if (RefEntities.Count > 0)
			{
				list.Add(eEntities.CopyEntity(RefEntities[0]));
				for (int i = 1; i <= RefEntities.Count - 1; i++)
				{
					if (RefEntities[0].GetType() == RefEntities[i].GetType())
					{
						list.Add(eEntities.CopyEntity(RefEntities[i]));
					}
				}
				if (list[0].GetType() == typeof(eLine))
				{
					num = PointAngle(list2[0].Vertice[list2[0].Vertice.Count - 1], list2[0].Vertice[0], Plane);
					pnt3D = ((list2[0].camDirections == camPathDirectionType.Normal) ? new Pnt3D(list2[0].Vertice[0]) : new Pnt3D(list2[0].Vertice[list2[0].Vertice.Count - 1]));
					bool flag = false;
					for (int j = 1; j <= list2.Count - 1; j++)
					{
						num2 = PointAngle(list2[j].Vertice[list2[j].Vertice.Count - 1], list2[j].Vertice[0], Plane);
						double value = Math.Abs(num2 - num);
						flag = true;
						if (buCompare.EQ(value, 0.0, 0.01) | buCompare.EQ(value, 180.0, 0.01))
						{
							flag = false;
						}
					}
					if (flag)
					{
						return -1;
					}
					pnt3D2 = ((list2[list2.Count - 1].camDirections == camPathDirectionType.Normal) ? new Pnt3D(list2[list2.Count - 1].Vertice[list2[list2.Count - 1].Vertice.Count - 1]) : new Pnt3D(list2[list2.Count - 1].Vertice[0]));
					CombinedEntity = new eLine(pnt3D, pnt3D2, RefEntities[0].dispThickness, RefEntities[0].dispColor);
					eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntities[0], ref CombinedEntity);
				}
				if (list[0].GetType() == typeof(eArc))
				{
					bool flag2 = false;
					double num3 = -9999999.0;
					double num4 = 9999999.0;
					for (int k = 0; k <= list.Count - 1; k++)
					{
						flag2 = false;
						if (buCompare.EQ(((eArc)list[k]).CenterPoint, ((eArc)list[0]).CenterPoint, 0.01) && buCompare.EQ(((eArc)list[k]).Radius, ((eArc)list[0]).Radius, 0.01))
						{
							flag2 = true;
							if (((eArc)list[k]).StartAngle < num4)
							{
								num4 = ((eArc)list[k]).StartAngle;
							}
							if (((eArc)list[k]).EndAngle > num3)
							{
								num3 = ((eArc)list[k]).EndAngle;
							}
						}
					}
					if (!flag2)
					{
						return -1;
					}
					CombinedEntity = new eArc(((eArc)list[0]).CenterPoint, ((eArc)list[0]).Radius, num4, num3, ((eArc)list[0]).Plane, RefEntities[0].dispThickness, RefEntities[0].dispColor);
					eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntities[0], ref CombinedEntity);
				}
				return 1;
			}
			return -1;
		}
		catch (Exception)
		{
			return -1;
		}
	}

	public void OffsetEntitiesByDynamicalOffset(List<eEntities> RefEntities, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourDirection, ref List<eEntities> OffsetEntities)
	{
		try
		{
			List<Pnt3D> Points = new List<Pnt3D>();
			new List<eEntities>();
			bool flag = IsClosed(RefEntities);
			EntityToPoint(RefEntities, buSystem.EntitiesResolution, ref Points);
			ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType = PolygonDirection(Points);
			OffsetEntities.Clear();
			if (!flag)
			{
				if (RefEntities.Count == 1)
				{
					eEntities copiedEnt = new eEntities();
					eEntities OffsetedEntity = new eEntities();
					eEntities.CopyEntity(RefEntities[0], ref copiedEnt);
					if (!(copiedEnt.auxValue > 0.0))
					{
						if (OpenContourDirection != CamOpenContourType2.Right)
						{
							OffsetEntity(copiedEnt, copiedEnt.auxValue, CamOpenContourType2.Right, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity);
						}
						else
						{
							OffsetEntity(copiedEnt, copiedEnt.auxValue, CamOpenContourType2.Left, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity);
						}
					}
					else
					{
						OffsetEntity(copiedEnt, copiedEnt.auxValue, OpenContourDirection, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity);
					}
					OffsetEntities.Add(OffsetedEntity);
				}
				if (RefEntities.Count <= 1)
				{
					return;
				}
				for (int i = 0; i <= RefEntities.Count - 1; i++)
				{
					eEntities copiedEnt2 = new eEntities();
					eEntities OffsetedEntity2 = new eEntities();
					eEntities.CopyEntity(RefEntities[i], ref copiedEnt2);
					if (!(copiedEnt2.GetType() == typeof(eArc)))
					{
						OffsetEntity(copiedEnt2, copiedEnt2.auxValue, OpenContourDirection, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity2);
					}
					else
					{
						double offset = copiedEnt2.auxValue;
						if (((eArc)copiedEnt2).camDirections == camPathDirectionType.Reverse && OpenContourDirection == CamOpenContourType2.Right)
						{
							offset = 0.0 - copiedEnt2.auxValue;
						}
						if (((eArc)copiedEnt2).camDirections == camPathDirectionType.Normal && OpenContourDirection == CamOpenContourType2.Left)
						{
							offset = 0.0 - copiedEnt2.auxValue;
						}
						OffsetEntity(copiedEnt2, offset, OpenContourDirection, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity2);
					}
					OffsetEntities.Add(OffsetedEntity2);
				}
				eEntities eEntities2 = new eEntities();
				eEntities eEntities3 = new eEntities();
				for (int j = 1; j <= OffsetEntities.Count - 1; j++)
				{
					eEntities2 = new eEntities();
					eEntities3 = new eEntities();
					eEntities.CopyEntity(OffsetEntities[j - 1], ref eEntities2);
					eEntities.CopyEntity(OffsetEntities[j], ref eEntities3);
					Connect(ref eEntities2, ref eEntities3, new WorkPlane());
					OffsetEntities[j - 1] = eEntities2;
					OffsetEntities[j] = eEntities3;
				}
				return;
			}
			for (int k = 0; k <= RefEntities.Count - 1; k++)
			{
				eEntities copiedEnt3 = new eEntities();
				eEntities OffsetedEntity3 = new eEntities();
				eEntities.CopyEntity(RefEntities[k], ref copiedEnt3);
				if (clockDirectionType == ClockDirectionType.CW)
				{
					if (!(copiedEnt3.auxValue < 0.0))
					{
						OffsetEntity(copiedEnt3, copiedEnt3.auxValue, CamOpenContourType2.Left, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity3);
					}
					else
					{
						OffsetEntity(copiedEnt3, copiedEnt3.auxValue, CamOpenContourType2.Right, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity3);
					}
				}
				if (clockDirectionType == ClockDirectionType.CCW)
				{
					if (!(copiedEnt3.auxValue < 0.0))
					{
						if (!(copiedEnt3.auxValue > 0.0))
						{
							eEntities.CopyEntity(copiedEnt3, ref OffsetedEntity3);
						}
						else
						{
							OffsetEntity(copiedEnt3, copiedEnt3.auxValue, CamOpenContourType2.Right, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity3);
						}
					}
					else
					{
						OffsetEntity(copiedEnt3, copiedEnt3.auxValue, CamOpenContourType2.Left, 0.0, ref OffsetedEntity3);
					}
				}
				OffsetEntities.Add(OffsetedEntity3);
			}
			eEntities eEntities4 = new eEntities();
			eEntities eEntities5 = new eEntities();
			for (int l = 1; l <= OffsetEntities.Count - 1; l++)
			{
				eEntities4 = new eEntities();
				eEntities5 = new eEntities();
				eEntities.CopyEntity(OffsetEntities[l - 1], ref eEntities4);
				eEntities.CopyEntity(OffsetEntities[l], ref eEntities5);
				if (l != 22)
				{
				}
				Connect(ref eEntities4, ref eEntities5, new WorkPlane());
				OffsetEntities[l - 1] = eEntities4;
				OffsetEntities[l] = eEntities5;
			}
			eEntities4 = new eEntities();
			eEntities5 = new eEntities();
			eEntities.CopyEntity(OffsetEntities[OffsetEntities.Count - 1], ref eEntities4);
			eEntities.CopyEntity(OffsetEntities[0], ref eEntities5);
			Connect(ref eEntities4, ref eEntities5, new WorkPlane(), 0, 0);
			OffsetEntities[OffsetEntities.Count - 1] = eEntities4;
			OffsetEntities[0] = eEntities5;
		}
		catch (Exception mSException)
		{
			string text = "RefEntities: " + RefEntities.Count;
			buLog.addLog(text, "Not Ok", MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name);
			buException.throwException(mSException, MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name, ShowMessageBox: false, text);
		}
	}

	public void OffsetContour(List<Pnt3D> RefPoints, double Offset, OffsetCornerType CornerTypes, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourType, WorkPlane Plane, double PlaneOffset, ref List<Pnt3D> OffsetedPoints)
	{
		List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints2 = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
		OffsetContour(RefPoints, Offset, CornerTypes, OpenContourType, Plane, PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints2);
		if (OffsetedPoints2.Count > 0)
		{
			Pnt3D.Copy(OffsetedPoints2[0], ref OffsetedPoints);
		}
	}

	public void OffsetContour(List<Pnt3D> RefPoints, double Offset, OffsetCornerType CornerTypes, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourType, WorkPlane Plane, double PlaneOffset, ref List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints)
	{
		bool flag = false;
		ClipperOffset clipperOffset = new ClipperOffset();
		clipperOffset.MiterLimit = 100.0;
		new buClipper();
		List<IntPoint> list = new List<IntPoint>();
		List<IntPoint> list2 = new List<IntPoint>();
		List<List<IntPoint>> solution = new List<List<IntPoint>>();
		OffsetedPoints = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
		if (RefPoints.Count > 1 && buCompare.EQ(RefPoints[0], RefPoints[RefPoints.Count - 1], buSystem.resolutionCompare))
		{
			flag = true;
		}
		JoinType joinType = JoinType.jtRound;
		if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Round)
		{
			joinType = JoinType.jtRound;
		}
		if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Line)
		{
			joinType = JoinType.jtMiter;
		}
		if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Chamfer)
		{
			joinType = JoinType.jtSquare;
		}
		if (WorkPlane.isPlaneXZ(Plane))
		{
			for (int i = 0; i <= RefPoints.Count - 1; i++)
			{
				Pnt3D CalcPoint = new Pnt3D();
				PointConversionByPlane(Plane, new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), RefPoints[i], ref CalcPoint);
				RefPoints[i] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint);
			}
		}
		if (WorkPlane.isPlaneYZ(Plane))
		{
			for (int j = 0; j <= RefPoints.Count - 1; j++)
			{
				Pnt3D CalcPoint2 = new Pnt3D();
				PointConversionByPlane(Plane, new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), RefPoints[j], ref CalcPoint2);
				RefPoints[j] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint2);
			}
		}
		for (int k = 0; k <= RefPoints.Count - 1; k++)
		{
			IntPoint item = new IntPoint(Convert.ToInt32(RefPoints[k].X * (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts), Convert.ToInt32(RefPoints[k].Y * (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts));
			list.Add(item);
		}
		list2 = new List<IntPoint>(list);
		EndType endType = EndType.etClosedPolygon;
		if (!flag)
		{
			if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Line || CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Chamfer)
			{
				endType = EndType.etOpenSquare;
			}
			if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Round)
			{
				endType = EndType.etOpenRound;
			}
			if (OpenContourType == CamOpenContourType2.Left || OpenContourType == CamOpenContourType2.Right || OpenContourType == CamOpenContourType2.ClosedNoTips)
			{
				endType = EndType.etOpenButt;
			}
			Offset = Math.Abs(Offset);
		}
		clipperOffset.AddPath(list2, joinType, endType);
		clipperOffset.Execute(ref solution, Offset * (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts);
		if (solution.Count >= 1)
		{
			for (int l = 0; l <= solution.Count - 1; l++)
			{
				List<Pnt3D> list3 = new List<Pnt3D>();
				for (int m = 0; m <= solution[l].Count - 1; m++)
				{
					Pnt3D pnt3D = new Pnt3D((double)solution[l][m].X / (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts, (double)solution[l][m].Y / (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts, solution[l][m].Z);
					pnt3D.Z = PlaneOffset;
					list3.Add(pnt3D);
				}
				if (list3.Count >= 2 && !buCompare.EQ(list3[0], list3[list3.Count - 1], buSystem.resolutionCompare))
				{
					Pnt3D pnt3D2 = new Pnt3D(list3[0]);
					pnt3D2.Z = PlaneOffset;
					list3.Add(new Pnt3D(list3[0]));
				}
				OffsetedPoints.Add(list3);
			}
		}
		if (WorkPlane.isPlaneXZ(Plane))
		{
			for (int n = 0; n <= OffsetedPoints.Count - 1; n++)
			{
				for (int num = 0; num <= OffsetedPoints[n].Count - 1; num++)
				{
					Pnt3D CalcPoint3 = new Pnt3D();
					PointConversionByPlane(new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), Plane, OffsetedPoints[n][num], ref CalcPoint3);
					OffsetedPoints[n][num] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint3);
				}
			}
		}
		if (!WorkPlane.isPlaneYZ(Plane))
		{
			return;
		}
		for (int num2 = 0; num2 <= OffsetedPoints.Count - 1; num2++)
		{
			for (int num3 = 0; num3 <= OffsetedPoints[num2].Count - 1; num3++)
			{
				Pnt3D CalcPoint4 = new Pnt3D();
				PointConversionByPlane(new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), Plane, OffsetedPoints[num2][num3], ref CalcPoint4);
				OffsetedPoints[num2][num3] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint4);
			}
		}
	}

	public void OffsetContour(List<List<Pnt3D>> RefPoints, double Offset, OffsetCornerType CornerTypes, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourType, WorkPlane Plane, double PlaneOffset, ref List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints)
	{
		ClipperOffset clipperOffset = new ClipperOffset();
		List<IntPoint> list = new List<IntPoint>();
		List<List<IntPoint>> list2 = new List<List<IntPoint>>();
		List<List<IntPoint>> solution = new List<List<IntPoint>>();
		OffsetedPoints = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
		JoinType joinType = JoinType.jtRound;
		if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Round)
		{
			joinType = JoinType.jtRound;
		}
		if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Line)
		{
			joinType = JoinType.jtMiter;
		}
		if (CornerTypes == OffsetCornerType.Chamfer)
		{
			joinType = JoinType.jtSquare;
		}
		if (WorkPlane.isPlaneXZ(Plane))
		{
			for (int i = 0; i <= RefPoints.Count - 1; i++)
			{
				for (int j = 0; j <= RefPoints[i].Count - 1; j++)
				{
					Pnt3D CalcPoint = new Pnt3D();
					PointConversionByPlane(Plane, new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), RefPoints[i][j], ref CalcPoint);
					RefPoints[i][j] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint);
				}
			}
		}
		if (WorkPlane.isPlaneYZ(Plane))
		{
			for (int k = 0; k <= RefPoints.Count - 1; k++)
			{
				for (int l = 0; l <= RefPoints[k].Count - 1; l++)
				{
					Pnt3D CalcPoint2 = new Pnt3D();
					PointConversionByPlane(Plane, new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), RefPoints[k][l], ref CalcPoint2);
					RefPoints[k][l] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint2);
				}
			}
		}
		ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType = PolygonDirection(RefPoints[0], new WorkPlane());
		for (int m = 0; m <= RefPoints.Count - 1; m++)
		{
			if (m > 0)
			{
				ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType2 = PolygonDirection(RefPoints[m], new WorkPlane());
				if (clockDirectionType2 == clockDirectionType)
				{
					RefPoints[m].Reverse();
				}
			}
			list = new List<IntPoint>();
			for (int n = 0; n <= RefPoints[m].Count - 1; n++)
			{
				IntPoint item = new IntPoint(Convert.ToInt32(RefPoints[m][n].X * (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts), Convert.ToInt32(RefPoints[m][n].Y * (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts));
				list.Add(item);
			}
			List<IntPoint> item2 = new List<IntPoint>(list);
			list2.Add(item2);
		}
		clipperOffset.AddPaths(list2, joinType, EndType.etClosedPolygon);
		clipperOffset.Execute(ref solution, Offset * (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts);
		if (solution.Count >= 1)
		{
			for (int num = 0; num <= solution.Count - 1; num++)
			{
				List<Pnt3D> list3 = new List<Pnt3D>();
				for (int num2 = 0; num2 <= solution[num].Count - 1; num2++)
				{
					Pnt3D item3 = new Pnt3D((double)solution[num][num2].X / (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts, (double)solution[num][num2].Y / (double)buSystem.DoubleToIntegerConts, solution[num][num2].Z);
					list3.Add(item3);
				}
				if (list3.Count >= 2 && !buCompare.EQ(list3[0], list3[list3.Count - 1]))
				{
					Pnt3D pnt3D = new Pnt3D(list3[0]);
					pnt3D.Z = PlaneOffset;
					list3.Add(pnt3D);
				}
				OffsetedPoints.Add(list3);
			}
		}
		if (WorkPlane.isPlaneXZ(Plane))
		{
			for (int num3 = 0; num3 <= OffsetedPoints.Count - 1; num3++)
			{
				for (int num4 = 0; num4 <= OffsetedPoints[num3].Count - 1; num4++)
				{
					Pnt3D CalcPoint3 = new Pnt3D();
					PointConversionByPlane(new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), Plane, OffsetedPoints[num3][num4], ref CalcPoint3);
					OffsetedPoints[num3][num4] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint3);
				}
			}
		}
		if (!WorkPlane.isPlaneYZ(Plane))
		{
			return;
		}
		for (int num5 = 0; num5 <= OffsetedPoints.Count - 1; num5++)
		{
			for (int num6 = 0; num6 <= OffsetedPoints[num5].Count - 1; num6++)
			{
				Pnt3D CalcPoint4 = new Pnt3D();
				PointConversionByPlane(new WorkPlane(planeType.XY, 1), Plane, OffsetedPoints[num5][num6], ref CalcPoint4);
				OffsetedPoints[num5][num6] = new Pnt3D(CalcPoint4);
			}
		}
	}

	public void OffsetContour(List<Pnt3D> OutterPoints, List<List<Pnt3D>> InnerPoints, double Offset, OffsetCornerType CornerTypes, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourType, WorkPlane Plane, double PlaneOffset, ref List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints)
	{
		List<List<Pnt3D>> list = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
		List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt = new List<Pnt3D>();
		Pnt3D.Copy(OutterPoints, ref CopiedPnt);
		list.Add(CopiedPnt);
		ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType = PolygonDirection(OutterPoints, Plane);
		for (int i = 0; i <= InnerPoints.Count - 1; i++)
		{
			bool flag = true;
			CopiedPnt = new List<Pnt3D>();
			Pnt3D.Copy(InnerPoints[i], ref CopiedPnt);
			for (int j = 0; j <= CopiedPnt.Count - 1; j++)
			{
				flag &= IsPointInsidePolygon(OutterPoints, CopiedPnt[j], Plane);
			}
			if (flag)
			{
				ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType2 = PolygonDirection(CopiedPnt, Plane);
				if (clockDirectionType2 != clockDirectionType)
				{
					list.Add(CopiedPnt);
					continue;
				}
				CopiedPnt.Reverse();
				list.Add(CopiedPnt);
			}
		}
		OffsetContour(list, Offset, CornerTypes, OpenContourType, Plane, PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints);
	}

	public void OffsetContourUntilEnd(List<Pnt3D> OutterPoints, List<List<Pnt3D>> InnerPoints, double Offset, OffsetCornerType CornerTypes, WorkPlane Plane, double PlaneOffset, ClockDirectionType NeededDirection, ref List<PocketPoints> Pockets, ref List<List<eEntities>> PocketEntities)
	{
		if (Offset > 0.0)
		{
			Offset *= -1.0;
		}
		List<ContourPoints> list = new List<ContourPoints>();
		ContourPoints contourPoints = new ContourPoints();
		Pnt3D.Copy(OutterPoints, ref contourPoints.Outter);
		Pnt3D.Copy(InnerPoints, ref contourPoints.Holes);
		list.Add(contourPoints);
		for (int i = 0; i <= list.Count - 1; i++)
		{
			int num = 0;
			bool flag = false;
			bool flag2 = true;
			Pnt3D pnt3D = new Pnt3D();
			Pnt3D pnt = new Pnt3D();
			List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt = new List<Pnt3D>();
			List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt2 = new List<Pnt3D>();
			List<List<Pnt3D>> list2 = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
			List<List<Pnt3D>> list3 = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
			List<List<Pnt3D>> CopiedPnt3 = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
			PocketPoints pocketPoints = new PocketPoints();
			List<eEntities> list4 = new List<eEntities>();
			if (flag = IsClosed(list[i].Outter))
			{
				Pnt3D.Copy(list[i].Outter, ref CopiedPnt);
			}
			for (int j = 0; j <= list[i].Holes.Count - 1; j++)
			{
				if (flag = IsClosed(list[i].Holes[j]))
				{
					List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt4 = new List<Pnt3D>();
					Pnt3D.Copy(list[i].Holes[j], ref CopiedPnt4);
					list2.Add(CopiedPnt4);
				}
			}
			if (CopiedPnt.Count <= 0)
			{
				continue;
			}
			pnt3D = new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt[0]);
			Pnt3D.Copy(CopiedPnt, ref CopiedPnt2);
			CopiedPnt3.Add(CopiedPnt2);
			do
			{
				List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
				List<List<Pnt3D>> TargetList = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
				List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt5 = new List<Pnt3D>();
				if (num != 0)
				{
					for (int k = 0; k <= CopiedPnt3.Count - 1; k++)
					{
						if (list2.Count != 0)
						{
							OffsetContour(CopiedPnt3[k], list2, Offset, OffsetCornerType.Line, CamOpenContourType2.Closed, Plane, PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints);
						}
						else
						{
							OffsetContour(CopiedPnt3[k], Offset, OffsetCornerType.Line, CamOpenContourType2.Closed, Plane, PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints);
						}
						Pnt3D.Add(OffsetedPoints, ref TargetList);
					}
				}
				else
				{
					for (int l = 0; l <= CopiedPnt3.Count - 1; l++)
					{
						if (list2.Count != 0)
						{
							OffsetContour(CopiedPnt3[l], list2, Offset, OffsetCornerType.Line, CamOpenContourType2.Closed, Plane, PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints);
						}
						else
						{
							OffsetContour(CopiedPnt3[l], Offset, OffsetCornerType.Line, CamOpenContourType2.Closed, Plane, PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints);
						}
						List<eEntities> CalcEnt = new List<eEntities>();
						AddPointOffsetedPath(OffsetedPoints, CopiedPnt2, Offset, flag, NeededDirection, 0.1, ref CalcEnt);
						for (int m = 0; m <= CalcEnt.Count - 1; m++)
						{
							CopiedPnt5 = new List<Pnt3D>();
							Pnt3D.Copy(CalcEnt[m].Vertice, ref CopiedPnt5);
							ShiftPointsByLength(pnt3D, ref CopiedPnt5);
							CopiedPnt5.Add(new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt5[0]));
							CheckDuplicatedPointsWithPrevious(ref CopiedPnt5);
							TargetList.Add(CopiedPnt5);
						}
						if (TargetList.Count <= 1)
						{
							continue;
						}
						for (int n = 0; n <= TargetList.Count - 1; n++)
						{
							for (int num2 = 1; num2 <= TargetList.Count - 1; num2++)
							{
								double num3 = Length3D(pnt3D, TargetList[num2][0]);
								double num4 = Length3D(pnt3D, TargetList[num2 - 1][0]);
								if (num3 < num4)
								{
									List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt6 = new List<Pnt3D>();
									List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt7 = new List<Pnt3D>();
									Pnt3D.Copy(TargetList[num2 - 1], ref CopiedPnt6);
									Pnt3D.Copy(TargetList[num2], ref CopiedPnt7);
									TargetList[num2 - 1] = CopiedPnt7;
									TargetList[num2] = CopiedPnt6;
								}
							}
						}
					}
				}
				num++;
				CopiedPnt3.Clear();
				if (TargetList.Count == 1)
				{
					if (pocketPoints.Pockets.Count <= 0)
					{
						Pnt3D.Copy(TargetList, ref CopiedPnt5);
					}
					else
					{
						CopiedPnt5 = new List<Pnt3D>();
						Pnt3D.Copy(TargetList, ref CopiedPnt5);
						ShiftPointsByLength(new Pnt3D(pnt), ref CopiedPnt5);
						CopiedPnt5.Add(new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt5[0]));
						CheckDuplicatedPointsWithPrevious(ref CopiedPnt5);
					}
					Pnt3D.Copy(TargetList, ref CopiedPnt3);
					ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType = PolygonDirection(CopiedPnt5, new WorkPlane());
					if (clockDirectionType != NeededDirection)
					{
						CopiedPnt5.Reverse();
					}
					new List<eEntities>();
					pocketPoints.Pockets.Add(CopiedPnt5);
					list4 = new List<eEntities>();
					PointsToEntitiesPar pars = new PointsToEntitiesPar();
					PointsToEntities(CopiedPnt5, Plane, pars, ref list4);
					PocketEntities.Add(list4);
					pnt = new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt5[CopiedPnt5.Count - 1]);
				}
				if (TargetList.Count > 1)
				{
					CopiedPnt5 = new List<Pnt3D>();
					Pnt3D.Copy(TargetList[0], ref CopiedPnt5);
					ShiftPointsByLength(new Pnt3D(pnt), ref CopiedPnt5);
					CopiedPnt5.Add(new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt5[0]));
					CheckDuplicatedPointsWithPrevious(ref CopiedPnt5);
					pocketPoints.Pockets.Add(CopiedPnt5);
					list4 = new List<eEntities>();
					PointsToEntitiesPar pars2 = new PointsToEntitiesPar();
					PointsToEntities(CopiedPnt5, Plane, pars2, ref list4);
					PocketEntities.Add(list4);
					CopiedPnt3.Add(CopiedPnt5);
					pnt = new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt5[CopiedPnt5.Count - 1]);
					for (int num5 = 1; num5 <= TargetList.Count - 1; num5++)
					{
						ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType2 = PolygonDirection(TargetList[num5], new WorkPlane());
						if (clockDirectionType2 != NeededDirection)
						{
							TargetList[num5].Reverse();
						}
						CopiedPnt5 = new List<Pnt3D>();
						Pnt3D.Copy(TargetList[num5], ref CopiedPnt5);
						if (!IsPointsSame(list3, CopiedPnt5))
						{
							list3.Add(CopiedPnt5);
						}
					}
				}
				if ((TargetList.Count == 0) & (list3.Count == 0))
				{
					flag2 = false;
				}
				if ((TargetList.Count == 0) & (list3.Count > 0))
				{
					CopiedPnt.Clear();
					CopiedPnt5 = new List<Pnt3D>();
					ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType3 = PolygonDirection(list3[0], new WorkPlane());
					if (clockDirectionType3 != NeededDirection)
					{
						list3[0].Reverse();
					}
					Pnt3D.Copy(list3[0], ref CopiedPnt5);
					pocketPoints.Pockets.Add(CopiedPnt5);
					list4 = new List<eEntities>();
					PointsToEntitiesPar pars3 = new PointsToEntitiesPar();
					PointsToEntities(CopiedPnt5, Plane, pars3, ref list4);
					PocketEntities.Add(list4);
					CopiedPnt3.Add(CopiedPnt5);
					list3.RemoveAt(0);
				}
				TargetList.Clear();
			}
			while (flag2);
			Pockets.Add(pocketPoints);
		}
	}

	public void OpenProfileCalculation(List<Pnt3D> OffsetedPoints, List<Pnt3D> EntityPoints, double Offset, WorkPlane Plane, CamOpenContourType2 ContourDirection, ref List<Pnt3D> CalcPoints)
	{
		if (Offset == 0.0 || ContourDirection == CamOpenContourType2.Center)
		{
			return;
		}
		int num = -1;
		int num2 = -1;
		List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt = new List<Pnt3D>();
		Pnt3D.Copy(OffsetedPoints, ref CopiedPnt);
		CheckDuplicatedPointsWithPrevious(ref CopiedPnt);
		ShiftPointsByLength(EntityPoints[0], EntityPoints[1], OnlyXYPlane: true, ref CopiedPnt);
		Length3D(CopiedPnt[0], EntityPoints[0]);
		Length3D(CopiedPnt[1], EntityPoints[1]);
		if (CopiedPnt.Count > 1)
		{
			double value = Length3D(CopiedPnt[0], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
			double value2 = Length3D(CopiedPnt[1], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
			if (buCompare.EQ(value, value2))
			{
				ShiftList(ref CopiedPnt, -1);
			}
		}
		for (int i = 0; i <= CopiedPnt.Count - 1; i++)
		{
			double value3 = Length3D(EntityPoints[0], CopiedPnt[i], Plane);
			double value4 = Length3D(EntityPoints[EntityPoints.Count - 1], CopiedPnt[i], Plane);
			if (buCompare.EQ(value3, Math.Abs(Offset)) && num == -1)
			{
				num = i;
			}
			if (buCompare.EQ(value4, Math.Abs(Offset)))
			{
				num2 = i;
			}
		}
		List<Pnt3D> list = new List<Pnt3D>();
		List<Pnt3D> list2 = new List<Pnt3D>();
		for (int j = num; j < num2; j++)
		{
			if (j >= 0)
			{
				Pnt3D item = new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt[j]);
				list.Add(item);
			}
		}
		for (int k = num2; k <= CopiedPnt.Count - 1; k++)
		{
			if (k >= 0)
			{
				Pnt3D item2 = new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt[k]);
				list2.Add(item2);
			}
		}
		list2.Reverse();
		if (list2.Count > 1)
		{
			double value5 = Length3D(list2[0], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
			double value6 = Length3D(list2[1], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
			if (buCompare.EQ(value5, value6))
			{
				list2.RemoveAt(0);
			}
			if (list2.Count > 1)
			{
				value5 = Length3D(list2[list2.Count - 1], EntityPoints[EntityPoints.Count - 1], Plane);
				value6 = Length3D(list2[list2.Count - 2], EntityPoints[EntityPoints.Count - 1], Plane);
				if (buCompare.EQ(value5, value6))
				{
					list2.RemoveAt(list2.Count - 1);
				}
			}
		}
		if (list.Count > 1)
		{
			double value7 = Length3D(list[0], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
			double value8 = Length3D(list[1], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
			if (buCompare.EQ(value7, value8))
			{
				list.RemoveAt(0);
			}
			value7 = Length3D(list[list.Count - 1], EntityPoints[EntityPoints.Count - 1], Plane);
			value8 = Length3D(list[list.Count - 2], EntityPoints[EntityPoints.Count - 1], Plane);
			if (buCompare.EQ(value7, value8))
			{
				list.RemoveAt(list.Count - 1);
			}
		}
		double num3 = 0.0;
		double num4 = 0.0;
		if (list.Count > 1)
		{
			num3 = PointAngle(list[1], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
		}
		if (list2.Count > 1)
		{
			num4 = PointAngle(list2[1], EntityPoints[0], Plane);
		}
		double num5 = Math.Abs(num3 - num4);
		if (num5 > 180.0)
		{
			if (!(num3 < num4))
			{
				num4 += 360.0;
			}
			else
			{
				num3 += 360.0;
			}
		}
		if (ContourDirection == CamOpenContourType2.Right)
		{
			if (!(num3 < num4))
			{
				Pnt3D.Copy(list2, ref CalcPoints);
			}
			else
			{
				Pnt3D.Copy(list, ref CalcPoints);
			}
		}
		if (ContourDirection == CamOpenContourType2.Left)
		{
			if (!(num3 > num4))
			{
				Pnt3D.Copy(list2, ref CalcPoints);
			}
			else
			{
				Pnt3D.Copy(list, ref CalcPoints);
			}
		}
	}

	public void OffsetEntity(eEntities RefEntity, double Offset, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourType, double PlaneOffset, ref eEntities OffsetedEntity)
	{
		try
		{
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eLine))
			{
				eEntities copiedEnt = new eLine(RefEntity.Vertice[0], RefEntity.Vertice[1]);
				if (RefEntity.camDirections == camPathDirectionType.Reverse)
				{
					copiedEnt = new eLine(RefEntity.Vertice[1], RefEntity.Vertice[0]);
				}
				eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntity, ref copiedEnt);
				List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
				OffsetContour(copiedEnt.Vertice, Offset, OffsetCornerType.Line, OpenContourType, new WorkPlane(), PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints);
				if (OffsetedPoints.Count > 0)
				{
					double num = PointAngle(copiedEnt.Vertice[1], copiedEnt.Vertice[0]);
					for (int i = 1; i <= OffsetedPoints[0].Count - 1; i++)
					{
						Pnt3D pnt3D = new Pnt3D(OffsetedPoints[0][i - 1]);
						Pnt3D pnt3D2 = new Pnt3D(OffsetedPoints[0][i]);
						double value = Length3D(pnt3D, pnt3D2, new WorkPlane());
						if (!buCompare.EQ(copiedEnt.geoLength, value))
						{
							continue;
						}
						double num2 = 0.0;
						double num3 = 0.0;
						double value2 = Length3D(pnt3D, copiedEnt.Vertice[0], new WorkPlane());
						double value3 = Length3D(pnt3D2, copiedEnt.Vertice[0], new WorkPlane());
						if (buCompare.EQ(Math.Abs(Offset), value2, 0.05))
						{
							num2 = PointAngle(pnt3D2, copiedEnt.Vertice[0]);
							double num4 = num2 - num;
							if (num4 > 180.0)
							{
								num += 360.0;
								num4 = num2 - num;
							}
							if (num4 < -180.0)
							{
								num2 += 360.0;
								num4 = num2 - num;
							}
							if (OpenContourType == CamOpenContourType2.Left && num4 > 0.0)
							{
								OffsetedEntity = new eLine(pnt3D, pnt3D2);
							}
							if (OpenContourType == CamOpenContourType2.Right && num4 < 0.0)
							{
								OffsetedEntity = new eLine(pnt3D, pnt3D2);
							}
						}
						if (buCompare.EQ(Math.Abs(Offset), value3, 0.05))
						{
							num3 = PointAngle(pnt3D, copiedEnt.Vertice[0]);
							double num5 = num3 - num;
							if (num5 > 180.0)
							{
								num += 360.0;
								num5 = num3 - num;
							}
							if (num5 < -180.0)
							{
								num3 += 360.0;
								num5 = num3 - num;
							}
							if (OpenContourType == CamOpenContourType2.Left && num5 > 0.0)
							{
								OffsetedEntity = new eLine(pnt3D2, pnt3D);
							}
							if (OpenContourType == CamOpenContourType2.Right && num5 < 0.0)
							{
								OffsetedEntity = new eLine(pnt3D2, pnt3D);
							}
						}
					}
					eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntity, ref OffsetedEntity);
				}
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(ePolyline))
			{
				List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints2 = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
				OffsetContour(RefEntity.Vertice, Offset, OffsetCornerType.Line, OpenContourType, new WorkPlane(), PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints2);
				if (OffsetedPoints2.Count > 0)
				{
					List<Pnt3D> CalcPoints = new List<Pnt3D>();
					OpenProfileCalculation(OffsetedPoints2[0], RefEntity.Vertice, Offset, new WorkPlane(), OpenContourType, ref CalcPoints);
					OffsetedEntity = new ePolyline(CalcPoints);
					eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntity, ref OffsetedEntity);
				}
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eCircle))
			{
				OffsetedEntity = new eCircle(((eCircle)RefEntity).CenterPoint, ((eCircle)RefEntity).Radius + Offset, ((eCircle)RefEntity).Plane);
				eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntity, ref OffsetedEntity);
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eArc))
			{
				OffsetedEntity = new eArc(((eArc)RefEntity).CenterPoint, ((eArc)RefEntity).Radius + Offset, ((eArc)RefEntity).StartAngle, ((eArc)RefEntity).EndAngle, ((eArc)RefEntity).Plane);
				eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntity, ref OffsetedEntity);
			}
			if (RefEntity.GetType() == typeof(eEllipse))
			{
				OffsetedEntity = new eEllipse(((eEllipse)RefEntity).CenterPoint, ((eEllipse)RefEntity).MajorRadius + Offset, ((eEllipse)RefEntity).MinorRadius + Offset, ((eEllipse)RefEntity).Angle, ((eEllipse)RefEntity).Plane);
				eEntities.CopyCommonPorperties(RefEntity, ref OffsetedEntity);
			}
		}
		catch (Exception mSException)
		{
			string text = "RefEntity: " + RefEntity.ToString() + "- Offset: " + Offset + "- OpenContourType: " + OpenContourType.ToString() + "- PlaneOffset: " + PlaneOffset;
			buLog.addLog(text, "Not Ok", MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name);
			buException.throwException(mSException, MethodBase.GetCurrentMethod().Name, ShowMessageBox: false, text);
		}
	}

	public void OffsetEntity(ref eEntities RefEntity, double Offset, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourType, double PlaneOffset)
	{
		eEntities OffsetedEntity = new eEntities();
		OffsetEntity(RefEntity, Offset, OpenContourType, PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedEntity);
		RefEntity = new eEntities();
		eEntities.CopyEntity(OffsetedEntity, ref RefEntity);
	}

	public void AddPointOffsetedPath(List<List<Pnt3D>> PLL, List<Pnt3D> SortedPoints, double Offset, bool Closed, ClockDirectionType ClockDir, double Resolution, ref List<eEntities> CalcEnt)
	{
		for (int i = 0; i <= PLL.Count - 1; i++)
		{
			double num = PointAngle(SortedPoints[1], SortedPoints[0], new WorkPlane());
			Pnt3D BasePnt = new Pnt3D();
			Pnt3D EndPnt = new Pnt3D();
			Pnt3D BasePnt2 = new Pnt3D();
			Pnt3D EndPnt2 = new Pnt3D();
			LineWithLengthAndAngle(SortedPoints[0], Math.Abs(Offset), num + 90.0, new WorkPlane(), ref BasePnt, ref EndPnt);
			LineWithLengthAndAngle(SortedPoints[0], Math.Abs(Offset), num - 90.0, new WorkPlane(), ref BasePnt2, ref EndPnt2);
			List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt = new List<Pnt3D>();
			Pnt3D.Copy(PLL[i], ref CopiedPnt);
			for (int j = 1; j <= CopiedPnt.Count - 1; j++)
			{
				Pnt3D CalculatedPoint = new Pnt3D();
				double Distance = 0.0;
				if (IsPointOverLine(CopiedPnt[j - 1], CopiedPnt[j], EndPnt, new WorkPlane(), Resolution, ref CalculatedPoint, ref Distance) && Distance < Resolution)
				{
					CopiedPnt.Insert(j, CalculatedPoint);
					j = CopiedPnt.Count;
					PLL.RemoveAt(i);
					PLL.Insert(i, CopiedPnt);
				}
				if (j <= CopiedPnt.Count - 1 && IsPointOverLine(CopiedPnt[j - 1], CopiedPnt[j], EndPnt2, new WorkPlane(), Resolution, ref CalculatedPoint, ref Distance) && Distance < Resolution)
				{
					CopiedPnt.Insert(j, CalculatedPoint);
					j = CopiedPnt.Count;
					PLL.RemoveAt(i);
					PLL.Insert(i, CopiedPnt);
				}
			}
			ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType = PolygonDirection(PLL[i], new WorkPlane());
			if (clockDirectionType != ClockDir && Closed)
			{
				PLL[i].Reverse();
			}
			ePolyline item = new ePolyline(PLL[i]);
			CalcEnt.Add(item);
		}
	}

	public void AddPointOffsetedPath(List<Pnt3D> ModifiedPoints, List<Pnt3D> SortedOriginalPoints, double Offset, bool Closed, ClockDirectionType ClockDir, double Resolution, ref List<Pnt3D> CalcPoints)
	{
		double num = PointAngle(SortedOriginalPoints[1], SortedOriginalPoints[0], new WorkPlane());
		Pnt3D BasePnt = new Pnt3D();
		Pnt3D EndPnt = new Pnt3D();
		Pnt3D BasePnt2 = new Pnt3D();
		Pnt3D EndPnt2 = new Pnt3D();
		LineWithLengthAndAngle(SortedOriginalPoints[0], Math.Abs(Offset), num + 90.0, new WorkPlane(), ref BasePnt, ref EndPnt);
		LineWithLengthAndAngle(SortedOriginalPoints[0], Math.Abs(Offset), num - 90.0, new WorkPlane(), ref BasePnt2, ref EndPnt2);
		List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt = new List<Pnt3D>();
		Pnt3D.Copy(ModifiedPoints, ref CopiedPnt);
		for (int i = 1; i <= CopiedPnt.Count - 1; i++)
		{
			Pnt3D CalculatedPoint = new Pnt3D();
			double Distance = 0.0;
			if (IsPointOverLine(CopiedPnt[i - 1], CopiedPnt[i], EndPnt, new WorkPlane(), Resolution, ref CalculatedPoint, ref Distance) && Distance < Resolution)
			{
				CopiedPnt.Insert(i, new Pnt3D(CalculatedPoint.X, CalculatedPoint.Y, CopiedPnt[i].Z));
				i = CopiedPnt.Count;
			}
			if (i <= CopiedPnt.Count - 1 && IsPointOverLine(CopiedPnt[i - 1], CopiedPnt[i], EndPnt2, new WorkPlane(), Resolution, ref CalculatedPoint, ref Distance) && Distance < Resolution)
			{
				CopiedPnt.Insert(i, new Pnt3D(CalculatedPoint.X, CalculatedPoint.Y, CopiedPnt[i].Z));
				i = CopiedPnt.Count;
			}
		}
		ClockDirectionType clockDirectionType = PolygonDirection(ModifiedPoints, new WorkPlane());
		if (clockDirectionType != ClockDir && Closed)
		{
			ModifiedPoints.Reverse();
		}
		CalcPoints = new List<Pnt3D>(CopiedPnt);
	}

	public void ShiftPointsAndPointsToEntities(Pnt3D StartPoint, double OverlapDistance, WorkPlane Plane, ClockDirectionType ClockDir, bool Closed, double Resolution, ref List<eEntities> CalcEnt)
	{
		List<eEntities> list = new List<eEntities>();
		for (int i = 0; i <= CalcEnt.Count - 1; i++)
		{
			List<Pnt3D> CopiedPnt = new List<Pnt3D>();
			Pnt3D.Copy(CalcEnt[i].Vertice, ref CopiedPnt);
			ShiftPointsByLength(StartPoint, ref CopiedPnt);
			CopiedPnt.Add(new Pnt3D(CopiedPnt[0]));
			CheckDuplicatedPointsWithPrevious(ref CopiedPnt);
			List<eEntities> CalcEntities = new List<eEntities>();
			PointsToEntitiesPar pointsToEntitiesPar = new PointsToEntitiesPar();
			pointsToEntitiesPar.LengthFilter = Resolution;
			PointsToEntities(CopiedPnt, Plane, pointsToEntitiesPar, ref CalcEntities);
			for (int j = 0; j <= CalcEntities.Count - 1; j++)
			{
				if (CalcEntities[j].geoLength > 0.0)
				{
					list.Add(eEntities.CopyEntity(CalcEntities[j]));
				}
			}
		}
		CalcEnt.Clear();
		new List<Pnt3D>();
	}

	public void OffsetAndTrimSingleEntityFromGroup(ref List<eEntities> Entities, int EntityIndex, double Offset, double PlaneOffset, CamOpenContourType2 OpenContourType)
	{
		if (EntityIndex >= 0 && EntityIndex <= Entities.Count - 1)
		{
			eEntities copiedEnt = new eEntities();
			List<Pnt3D> Points = new List<Pnt3D>();
			List<List<Pnt3D>> OffsetedPoints = new List<List<Pnt3D>>();
			eEntities.CopyEntity(Entities[EntityIndex], ref copiedEnt);
			EntityToPoint(copiedEnt, ref Points);
			OffsetContour(Points, Offset, OffsetCornerType.Line, OpenContourType, new WorkPlane(), PlaneOffset, ref OffsetedPoints);
		}
	}

